  "title": "MoonLake Announces Positive Topline Results from the Phase 3 IZAR-1 Trial of Sonelokimab in Psoriatic Arthritis Demonstrating Significant Improvements Across all Clinical Endpoints, and Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Phase 3 IZAR-1 trial in bio-naïve patients met all clinical endpoints at Week 16 for 60 mg sonelokimab The primary endpoint of ACR50 was met with a high response of 42.1% for sonelokimab’s 60 mg with induction, and significant responses were observed across key secondary endpoints, including ACR20",
